#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Keramik"
msgstr "Keramik"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Nastajenja za dekoraciju woknow"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Display the window &icon in the caption bubble"
msgstr "&piktogram wokna w titlowym owalu pokazować"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the window icon to be displayed in the caption "
"bubble next to the titlebar text."
msgstr "Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li, zo so piktogram wokna pódla titloweho teksta pokazuje."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Draw &small caption bubbles on active windows"
msgstr "&Małe titlowe owale nad aktiwnymi woknami rysować"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the caption bubble to have the same size on "
"active windows that it has on inactive ones. This option is useful for "
"laptops or low resolution displays where you want maximize the amount of "
"space available to the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li, zo bychu titlowe owale aktiwnych woknow runje tak wulke "
"byli kaž titlowe owale njeaktiwnych woknow. Tuta opcija je wužitna za mjeńše wobrazowki, "
"hdyž chceće tak wjele ruma kaž móžno wobsahej wokna k dispoziciji stajić. "

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Draw g&rab bars below windows"
msgstr "Přesuwanske &pasy pod woknami rysować."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want a grab bar to be drawn below windows. When "
"this option is not selected only a thin border will be drawn in its place."
msgstr ""
"Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li, zo so přesuwanski pas pod woknom rysuje. Hdyž "
"tuta opcija njeje wubrana, rysuje so jenož ćeńka linija."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use shadowed &text"
msgstr "Wužiwaj &tekst ze sćinom "

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the titlebar text to have a 3D look with a "
"shadow behind it."
msgstr "Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li, zo by titlowy pas měł 3D-napohlad ze sćinom spody."

